repository-code: "https://github.com/tiaanjvr/czi-brightfield-stitching"
abstract: >-
  A Python and Fiji pipeline that batch-stitches Zeiss .czi brightfield
  mosaic scans into tiled, compressed OME-TIFF files with physical pixel
  sizes, including flat-field illumination correction, followed by a QuPath
  script for dual-threshold tissue masking.
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - image stitching
  - brightfield
  - histology
  - CZI
  - OME-TIFF
  - Fiji
  - QuPath
